    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/ebb2e252342334dfacfc89a76c6b47da.poster.avif?t=1751993497\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/ebb2e252342334dfacfc89a76c6b47da.webm?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/ebb2e252342334dfacfc89a76c6b47da.mp4?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A psychological computer game by jnity, assisted by celesware</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/7fd2d1db8522b1e145f592967df33fad.poster.avif?t=1751993497\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/7fd2d1db8522b1e145f592967df33fad.webm?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/7fd2d1db8522b1e145f592967df33fad.mp4?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILL THE FAMILIAR FACES RETURN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOMESICKNESS</strong> is a solely developed point-and-click free-roam psychological horror game that delves into the depths and nuances of nostalgia and primitive online media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Theo as he explores the empty, desolate halls of <strong>CHILDREEF</strong>, making his way to the lower floors. With the Kids' Multi-tool, uncover hidden exits and find your way down as you attempt to make sense of what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, collect items, find special tools for survival, and overcome what awaits in the seemingly empty corridors of <strong>CHILDREEF</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each game over, things begin to change. Previously visited paths become blocked, and disorientation starts to set in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on unseen corners; you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/5749a82ff0ea3179a47433730e7d70e6.poster.avif?t=1751993497\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/5749a82ff0ea3179a47433730e7d70e6.webm?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEST THE UNSEEN CORNERS HARBOR HIDDEN TRUTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as young Theo, awakening in a place long forgotten. In his possession is a lone tape, left behind by a loved one who holds a place in his heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remnants of the tape serve as your only guide, leading you deeper into the daycare of CHILDREEF. As you listen to the tape's fragmented messages, clues begin to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The voice that speaks on the other end is the one that will guide you. She waits for you to come, on your way down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/5d5335109570de18337a14b0076fc80f.poster.avif?t=1751993497\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/5d5335109570de18337a14b0076fc80f.webm?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/5d5335109570de18337a14b0076fc80f.mp4?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point-and-click free-roam exploration</strong> spanning three segments, where every corner must be checked; every item has a purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied mechanics for each threat</strong>, each centered around a different tool at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep dive into the nuances and symptoms of nostalgia</strong>, portrayed through an abstract, surreal lens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A flexible, carefully crafted 2000s aesthetic</strong> that reinforces the core themes and atmosphere of <strong>HOMESICKNESS</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lite gameplay randomization</strong>; with every death, room functions shift, previous exits disappear, and items appear in different locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An emotional, psychological story</strong>, woven into <strong>every</strong> aspect of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive post-game content</strong>, directly expanding on the main narrative; once you finish the game, there will still be much to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility options and a highly customizable UI</strong>; playable with both mouse and keyboard or mouse only. The game does not rely on sound, though audio enhances the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized performance</strong>, ensuring smooth gameplay on most mid-range modern computers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimum of 1GB of RAM is required to run the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/ebb2e252342334dfacfc89a76c6b47da.poster.avif?t=1751993497\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/ebb2e252342334dfacfc89a76c6b47da.webm?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/ebb2e252342334dfacfc89a76c6b47da.mp4?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A psychological computer game by jnity, assisted by celesware</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/7fd2d1db8522b1e145f592967df33fad.poster.avif?t=1751993497\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/7fd2d1db8522b1e145f592967df33fad.webm?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/7fd2d1db8522b1e145f592967df33fad.mp4?t=1751993497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILL THE FAMILIAR FACES RETURN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOMESICKNESS</strong> is a solely developed point-and-click free-roam psychological horror game that delves into the depths and nuances of nostalgia and primitive online media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Theo as he explores the empty, desolate halls of <strong>CHILDREEF</strong>, making his way to the lower floors. With the Kids' Multi-tool, uncover hidden exits and find your way down as you attempt to