    "short_description": "HOMESICKNESS is a point-&amp;-click psychological horror indie game exploring the nuances of nostalgia. Play as Theo, trapped in CHILDREEF\u2019s daycare, descending floor by floor; surviving the remnants of time. Use the Kids' multi-tool, listen to obscure tapes, and make your way to the lot. She's waiting.",
